{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02563","headline":"奉和圣制送来济应制 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和圣制送来济应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万乘腾镳警岐路，百壶供帐饯离宫。\n御沟分水声难绝，广宴当歌曲易终。\n兴言共伤千里道，俯迹聊示五情同。\n良哉既深留帝念，沃化方有赞天聪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}